{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai assistance and deterministic automation ai assistance and deterministic automation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","fileName":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted DevOps Practice]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted DevOps Practice","Automation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai assistance and deterministic automation ai assistance and deterministic automation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","fileName":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation","heading":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Generative AI produces new text, code, and configuration from learned patterns, while conventional [[Automation]] executes predefined rules. The first is probabilistic and context-dependent; the second should be repeatable enough that the same conditions produce an expected result or failure.\n\nA safe DevOps workflow uses each where its character is useful. AI may interpret a log or draft a pipeline, but deterministic code validates the syntax, enforces policy, and performs approved execution. Treating an LLM as interchangeable with automation hides uncertainty inside a system that depends on predictability.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted DevOps Practice","Automation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai assistance and deterministic automation ai assistance and deterministic automation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","fileName":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Assistance and Deterministic Automation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted DevOps Practice","Automation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}